   "text": "2 \u00b7 AddDocsPopup (modal)\nDrop PDFs / photos, max 20 MB each.\n\"Add to topic\" (curated): saves file names only, nothing is\nuploaded.\n\"Create topic\": startFromFiles(files), then\nnavigate(\"/study\")",
