   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Notes\n\u2022 Live updates use a WebSocket (/ws), not SSE. Each key event also triggers GET /api/courses/:id.\n\u2022 \"Clear resources\" (Header) calls POST /api/admin/reset and removes every \"krayon.*\" key from local and session storage.\n\u2022 With VITE_USE_BACKEND=false the lesson is built in the browser through POST /api/uploads + POST /api/ai/generate.",
   "originalText": "Notes\n\u2022 Live updates use a WebSocket (/ws), not SSE. Each key event also triggers GET /api/courses/:id.\n\u2022 \"Clear resources\" (Header) calls POST /api/admin/reset and removes every \"krayon.*\" key from local and session storage.\n\u2022 With VITE_USE_BACKEND=false the lesson is built in the browser through POST /api/uploads + POST /api/ai/generate.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rec-0129",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
