   "text": "POST /api/courses\nvalidate files: 400 empty / not PDF or image \u00b7\n413 > 20 MB \u00b7 422 none\nADC check \u2192 503 \u00b7 storage.put() each file \u00b7\ncourse doc {status:\"created\", sources}\nemit course.created \u00b7 jobs.submit(\"course\") \u2192\n{courseId, jobId}",
   "originalText": "POST /api/courses\nvalidate files: 400 empty / not PDF or image \u00b7 413 > 20 MB \u00b7 422 none\nADC check \u2192 503 \u00b7 storage.put() each file \u00b7 course doc {status:\"created\", sources}\nemit course.created \u00b7 jobs.submit(\"course\") \u2192 {courseId, jobId}",
