   "text": "LocalJobRunner (in process)\nkinds: course \u00b7 regenerate \u00b7 retrySegment \u00b7\nretryTopic \u00b7 ingest\njobs/<id>: queued \u2192 running \u2192 done | error\n\"course\" \u2192 pipeline.runCourse(uid, courseId)",
   "originalText": "LocalJobRunner (in process)\nkinds: course \u00b7 regenerate \u00b7 retrySegment \u00b7 retryTopic \u00b7 ingest\njobs/<id>: queued \u2192 running \u2192 done | error\n\"course\" \u2192 pipeline.runCourse(uid, courseId)",
