   "text": "LocalEventBus.emit(event)\nadds seq + ts \u00b7 logs every event (logger krayon.pipeline, with code + error on *.failed) \u00b7 fans out to /ws\nsubscribers \u00b7 cancel flags (isCancelled)\nevent types: course.created \u00b7 roadmap.started | ready \u00b7 topic.queued | started | ready | failed \u00b7\nlesson.drafted \u00b7 segment.check | render | review | fixed | ready | failed \u00b7 course.done | failed",
   "originalText": "LocalEventBus.emit(event)\nadds seq + ts \u00b7 logs every event (logger krayon.pipeline, with code + error on *.failed) \u00b7 fans out to /ws subscribers \u00b7 cancel flags (isCancelled)\nevent types: course.created \u00b7 roadmap.started | ready \u00b7 topic.queued | started | ready | failed \u00b7 lesson.drafted \u00b7 segment.check | render | review | fixed | ready | failed \u00b7 course.done | failed",
