   "text": "roadmapFlow\ncourse status \"roadmap\" \u2192 modelJson(\"roadmap\", 2\nattempts)\nsave roadmap, status \"lessons\"; topic docs\n\"queued\" (orderTopics)\nevents roadmap.started \u00b7 roadmap.ready \u00b7\ntopic.queued",
   "originalText": "roadmapFlow\ncourse status \"roadmap\" \u2192 modelJson(\"roadmap\", 2 attempts)\nsave roadmap, status \"lessons\"; topic docs \"queued\" (orderTopics)\nevents roadmap.started \u00b7 roadmap.ready \u00b7 topic.queued",
