   "text": "lessonFlow (per topic; TOPIC_CONCURRENCY, default\n1)\ntopic.started \u2192 modelJson(\"lesson\"): studyDoc +\n3-5 segments in ONE call (the study doc is not a\nseparate stage) \u2192 lesson.drafted",
