   "locked": false,
   "text": "segmentLoop + finish\ncheck/repair \u2192 render keyframes (Remotion\nrenderStill) \u2192 review (review model + keyframes)\n\u2192 fix (patchedSegment), \u2264 MAX_REVIEW_ROUNDS \u00b7\nsegment.ready\nsaveLesson \u2192 topic.ready \u00b7 none usable \u2192\ntopic.failed\nall topics \u2192 course.done | course.failed",
   "originalText": "segmentLoop + finish\ncheck/repair \u2192 render keyframes (Remotion renderStill) \u2192 review (review model + keyframes) \u2192 fix (patchedSegment), \u2264 MAX_REVIEW_ROUNDS \u00b7 segment.ready\nsaveLesson \u2192 topic.ready \u00b7 none usable \u2192 topic.failed\nall topics \u2192 course.done | course.failed",
