   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Vertex AI (GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT, default krayon-ai; location global) through the Genkit vertexAI plugin: ai.generate({model, prompt: source files as data URLs + text, output.jsonSchema}) \u2192 Vertex responseJsonSchema\n(generated from zod)\nrunGeminiCall: shared concurrency slots \u00b7 90 s abort \u00b7 up to 3 retries with backoff on 429 only (MAX_TOKENS, timeouts and other errors fail at once) \u00b7 models GEMINI_MODEL (drafts, repair) and GEMINI_REVIEW_MODEL\n(review); both default to gemini-2.5-flash",
   "originalText": "Vertex AI (GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT, default krayon-ai; location global) through the Genkit vertexAI plugin: ai.generate({model, prompt: source files as data URLs + text, output.jsonSchema}) \u2192 Vertex responseJsonSchema (generated from zod)\nrunGeminiCall: shared concurrency slots \u00b7 90 s abort \u00b7 up to 3 retries with backoff on 429 only (MAX_TOKENS, timeouts and other errors fail at once) \u00b7 models GEMINI_MODEL (drafts, repair) and GEMINI_REVIEW_MODEL (review); both default to gemini-2.5-flash",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rec-0187",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 71,
   "autoResize": false
  },
