   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1077282907,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 280811967,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1792236298564,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Also in the code\n\u2022 Updates reach the browser over a WebSocket (fastify/websocket), not SSE or polling; the client refetches the course on key\nevents.\n\u2022 Step outcomes can also be \"blocked\" (safety filter) or \"unreviewed\" (outcomes.ts).\n\u2022 Roadmap and lesson drafts get 2 validated attempts; every failed attempt logs ai.attempt with the first 1500 chars of raw\noutput.\n\u2022 Every log line of one course run shares the request_id of the POST that started it (jobs reuse AsyncLocalStorage).\n\u2022 POST /api/ai/generate (the in-browser fallback) calls Vertex through @google/genai directly, not through Genkit.",
   "originalText": "Also in the code\n\u2022 Updates reach the browser over a WebSocket (fastify/websocket), not SSE or polling; the client refetches the course on key events.\n\u2022 Step outcomes can also be \"blocked\" (safety filter) or \"unreviewed\" (outcomes.ts).\n\u2022 Roadmap and lesson drafts get 2 validated attempts; every failed attempt logs ai.attempt with the first 1500 chars of raw output.\n\u2022 Every log line of one course run shares the request_id of the POST that started it (jobs reuse AsyncLocalStorage).\n\u2022 POST /api/ai/generate (the in-browser fallback) calls Vertex through @google/genai directly, not through Genkit.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "rec-0250",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 146,
   "autoResize": false
  },
