   "text": "Ask a doubt at the current time (DoubtPanel)\nonAsk(question) appends {role:\"user\", text} +\n{role:\"krayon\", text: answer}\nanswer = current segment narration (else chapter\ntitle or topic summary)\nNo endpoint, no model call",
   "originalText": "Ask a doubt at the current time (DoubtPanel)\nonAsk(question) appends {role:\"user\", text} + {role:\"krayon\", text: answer}\nanswer = current segment narration (else chapter title or topic summary)\nNo endpoint, no model call",
