   "text": "POST /api/courses/:id/topics/:tid/segments/:sid/regenerate {prompt?}\nsegment lock \u2192 409 if busy \u00b7 job \"regenerate\" \u2192 runRegenerate: segmentPrompt (\"Explain this\none lesson segment in more depth\", 90-450 frames) \u2192 validate/repair \u2192 segmentLoop (check \u2192\nrender \u2192 review) \u2192 segment doc + saveLesson \u00b7 events segment.* / topic.ready\nfailure: previous segment restored with error + segment.failed \u2192 Retry (\u2026/retry)",
   "originalText": "POST /api/courses/:id/topics/:tid/segments/:sid/regenerate {prompt?}\nsegment lock \u2192 409 if busy \u00b7 job \"regenerate\" \u2192 runRegenerate: segmentPrompt (\"Explain this one lesson segment in more depth\", 90-450 frames) \u2192 validate/repair \u2192 segmentLoop (check \u2192 render \u2192 review) \u2192 segment doc + saveLesson \u00b7 events segment.* / topic.ready\nfailure: previous segment restored with error + segment.failed \u2192 Retry (\u2026/retry)",
